>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7f4d535 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7f4d535\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>How Philite\u00ae Improves The Performance of PTFE Filter Bags<\/h3><ul><li>Advanced needle punching technology, cross-laying, the number of layers is controlled between 6 and 8. The frequency of needle punching reaches 21,000 needles\/min.<\/li><li>Thickened PTFE microporous membrane with a porosity of more than 80%, high-precision filtration and breathability.<\/li><li>The modern professional filter material coating machine can film filter materials of all materials, and the coating is firm and even.<\/li><li>In order to prevent dust from entering through the suture needle space, the sutures and interfaces are glued and sealed, and the bag body is film-breaking and hot-melted.<\/li><li>Increase system filtration capacity by 50-150% as needed without major changes to the dust collector.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d53db98 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d53db98\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-efb61fa elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"efb61fa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ptfe-filter-bag-factory-\u8be6\u60c57.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3078\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/u